This directory contains the server implementation.

Architecture:
The server is implemented as a stereotypical REST application built on the
Flask server. It uses an RDBMS server accessed through sqlalchemy.
The datamodel consists of:
  /schedules
    /{name}
      /{phase number}
  /firings
    /{schedule-name}-{datettime}
      /phases
        /{phase}
        /metrics
      /metrics
  /devices
    /{name}
      /users   -> /users/{name}
      /schedules
        /start -> /schedules/{name}
        /end   -> /schedules/{name}
  /users
    /{name}
      /firings
        -> /firings/ filtered by user

Database:
The default database is an instance of sqllite, but the intent is to allow this to be
configured to use a more production-ready database.
